  "SubGoals": [],
  "Description": "This Goal, PLang.Modules.UiModule, processes a specific instruction to render a template based on a function's properties. It filters the instruction to find a function named 'RenderTemplate', checks if the function is a template file, and if so, reads a file from a specified path, renders a template, and appends the rendered content to a module.",
  "Visibility": 0,
  "GoalFileName": "CodePanel.goal",
